{"seq":1,"slug":"module-federation-runtime","title":"Module Federation 运行时机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-bundler-internals/advanced/module-federation-runtime","wordCount":1045,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"module-federation-运行时机制\">Module Federation 运行时机制</h1><p>Module Federation（MF）让独立部署的应用之间在运行时共享模块——Team A 部署的 remote 组件可以被 Team B 的 host 应用直接消费，无需重新构建。MF 2.0（2026 年 4 月稳定版）实现了一个关键架构变革：将运行时层从打包器内核中<strong>完全剥离</strong>，使同一套 Federation 协议可跨 Webpack/Rspack/Rollup/Rolldown/Vite 运行。本文从打包器视角拆解 MF 的构建期生成物和运行时协商协议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Module Federation 的核心机制由三个概念支撑：<strong>Container</strong>（每个 remote 暴露的入口接口，提供 <code>init</code>/<code>get</code> 方法）、<strong>Share Scope</strong>（共享依赖的运行时注册表，存储所有已加载的共享模块及其版本）、以及 <strong>Manifest</strong>（描述 remote 元数据的 JSON 协议，让 host 无需加载 container 即可发现可用模块）。构建期打包器负责生成这三者，运行时 SDK 负责协调它们。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构-构建期-vs-运行时\">架构：构建期 vs 运行时</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph BuildTime[构建期-打包器侧]&#10;        Plugin[MF Plugin] --&gt; Manifest[生成 mf-manifest.json]&#10;        Plugin --&gt; SharedChunk[生成 shared chunk]&#10;        Plugin --&gt; ExposedChunk[生成 exposed chunk]&#10;        Plugin --&gt; Container[生成 container entry]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph RuntimeSide[运行时-浏览器侧]&#10;        Runtime[MF Runtime SDK]&#10;        Runtime --&gt; Negotiate[共享依赖协商]&#10;        Runtime --&gt; Load[远程模块加载]&#10;        Runtime --&gt; Cache[缓存与版本控制]&#10;    end&#10;    Manifest --&gt; Runtime&#10;    Container --&gt; Runtime\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph BuildTime[构建期-打包器侧]\n        Plugin[MF Plugin] --&gt; Manifest[生成 mf-manifest.json]\n        Plugin --&gt; SharedChunk[生成 shared chunk]\n        Plugin --&gt; ExposedChunk[生成 exposed chunk]\n        Plugin --&gt; Container[生成 container entry]\n    end\n    subgraph RuntimeSide[运行时-浏览器侧]\n        Runtime[MF Runtime SDK]\n        Runtime --&gt; Negotiate[共享依赖协商]\n        Runtime --&gt; Load[远程模块加载]\n        Runtime --&gt; Cache[缓存与版本控制]\n    end\n    Manifest --&gt; Runtime\n    Container --&gt; Runtime</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>实现位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构建期插件</td>\n<td>分析 exposes/remotes/shared 配置，生成 chunk 和 manifest</td>\n<td>打包器插件（<code>@module-federation/enhanced</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Container Entry</td>\n<td>暴露模块的入口文件，提供 <code>get(module)</code> / <code>init(shareScope)</code> 接口</td>\n<td>打包器生成的 JS 代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Manifest</td>\n<td>描述远程模块的元数据（版本、chunk 列表、shared 信息）</td>\n<td>JSON 文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Runtime SDK</td>\n<td>运行时加载、协商、缓存逻辑</td>\n<td><code>@module-federation/enhanced/runtime</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"manifest-协议-mf-manifest-json\">Manifest 协议：mf-manifest.json</h2><p>MF 2.0 引入了标准化的 manifest 协议——每个 remote 在构建时生成一份 <code>mf-manifest.json</code>，host 在运行时通过 HTTP 获取它来发现可用模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;design_system&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2.1.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;metaData&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;buildHash&quot;: &quot;a1b2c3d4&quot;,&#10;    &quot;timestamp&quot;: 1714800000&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;exposes&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;./Button&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;chunks&quot;: [&quot;Button-chunk-abc.js&quot;],&#10;      &quot;size&quot;: 12400&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./Modal&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;chunks&quot;: [&quot;Modal-chunk-def.js&quot;, &quot;shared-animation.js&quot;],&#10;      &quot;size&quot;: 28000&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;shared&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;react&quot;: { &quot;version&quot;: &quot;19.1.0&quot;, &quot;singleton&quot;: true },&#10;    &quot;react-dom&quot;: { &quot;version&quot;: &quot;19.1.0&quot;, &quot;singleton&quot;: true }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"design_system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metaData\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"buildHash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a1b2c3d4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1714800000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exposes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./Button\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"chunks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Button-chunk-abc.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12400</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./Modal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"chunks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Modal-chunk-def.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"shared-animation.js\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"size\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">28000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"19.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"singleton\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"react-dom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"19.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"singleton\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>manifest 的设计让运行时无需加载 container entry 就能获取模块信息——实现了零成本的健康检查和版本发现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享依赖协商-运行时版本仲裁\">共享依赖协商：运行时版本仲裁</h2><p>当 host 和 remote 都依赖 <code>react</code> 时，MF 的核心任务是确保它们使用同一个实例（singleton 模式）。协商算法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Host as Host App&#10;    participant Runtime as MF Runtime&#10;    participant Remote as Remote App&#10;&#10;    Host-&gt;&gt;Runtime: init({ shared: { react: &#39;19.0.0&#39; } })&#10;    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Runtime: 注册 host 的 react 版本到 shareScope&#10;    Host-&gt;&gt;Runtime: loadRemote(&#39;design_system/Button&#39;)&#10;    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Remote: fetch mf-manifest.json&#10;    Remote--&gt;&gt;Runtime: manifest(react: &#39;19.1.0&#39;, singleton: true)&#10;    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Runtime: 版本协商: host 19.0.0 vs remote 19.1.0&#10;    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Runtime: 选择满足 semver 的最高版本&#10;    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Host: 使用 host 的 react(或加载 remote 的)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Host as Host App\n    participant Runtime as MF Runtime\n    participant Remote as Remote App\n\n    Host-&gt;&gt;Runtime: init({ shared: { react: '19.0.0' } })\n    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Runtime: 注册 host 的 react 版本到 shareScope\n    Host-&gt;&gt;Runtime: loadRemote('design_system/Button')\n    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Remote: fetch mf-manifest.json\n    Remote--&gt;&gt;Runtime: manifest(react: '19.1.0', singleton: true)\n    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Runtime: 版本协商: host 19.0.0 vs remote 19.1.0\n    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Runtime: 选择满足 semver 的最高版本\n    Runtime-&gt;&gt;Host: 使用 host 的 react(或加载 remote 的)</pre><p>版本协商规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>singleton: true</strong>：整个页面只能有一个实例。选择已加载版本（通常是 host 的）</li>\n<li><strong>semver 兼容</strong>：remote 要求 <code>^19.0.0</code>，host 提供 <code>19.0.0</code> → 兼容，复用 host 的</li>\n<li><strong>semver 不兼容</strong>：remote 要求 <code>^19.0.0</code>，host 提供 <code>18.2.0</code> → 不兼容，加载 remote 自带的 fallback</li>\n<li><strong>strictVersion: true</strong>：不容忍任何版本差异，不兼容时抛运行时错误</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"共享依赖的-tree-shaking\">共享依赖的 Tree Shaking</h2><p>传统 MF 的共享依赖是整包暴露——<code>react</code> 的所有导出都在共享 chunk 中。MF 2.0 + Rspack 2.0 的 tree shaking 改变了这一点：</p>\n<p><strong>runtime-infer 模式</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>构建时分析每个 remote 实际使用了 <code>react</code> 的哪些导出</li>\n<li>生成裁剪后的 shared chunk（只含 <code>useState</code>、<code>useEffect</code> 等）</li>\n<li>运行时如果另一个 remote 需要 <code>useContext</code>（不在裁剪集中），自动回退加载完整版</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>server-calc 模式</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>CI 中收集所有 remote 的使用报告</li>\n<li>计算全局最优的 shared 裁剪方案</li>\n<li>生成一份覆盖所有 remote 需求的精确 shared chunk</li>\n</ol>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>优化程度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无 tree shaking</td>\n<td>0% 减少</td>\n<td>零配置</td>\n<td>小型项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>runtime-infer</td>\n<td>~60-75% 减少</td>\n<td>低（构建时自动）</td>\n<td>大多数项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>server-calc</td>\n<td>~80-90% 减少</td>\n<td>高（需 CI 集成）</td>\n<td>超大型多团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"container-entry-的代码生成\">Container Entry 的代码生成</h2><p>打包器为每个配置了 <code>exposes</code> 的应用生成一个 container entry——一个特殊的 JS 文件，暴露两个核心函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 打包器自动生成&#10;var container = {&#10;  init: function (shareScope) {&#10;    // 将 host 提供的共享模块注册到本地 shareScope&#10;    // 执行版本协商&#10;  },&#10;  get: function (module) {&#10;    // 返回 Promise&lt;() =&gt; moduleExports&gt;&#10;    // 按需加载对应的 exposed chunk&#10;    return import(&#39;./exposed-&#39; + module + &#39;.js&#39;);&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 打包器自动生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> container </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shareScope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 将 host 提供的共享模块注册到本地 shareScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 执行版本协商</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 返回 Promise&#x3C;() => moduleExports></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 按需加载对应的 exposed chunk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./exposed-'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rspack/webpack 生成的 container entry 遵循相同的接口规范——这是 MF 跨打包器互操作的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预加载与性能优化\">预加载与性能优化</h2><p>MF 2.0 的 Runtime SDK 支持显式预加载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { preloadRemotes } from &#39;@module-federation/enhanced/runtime&#39;;&#10;&#10;await preloadRemotes([&#10;  {&#10;    nameOrAlias: &#39;checkout&#39;,&#10;    exposes: [&#39;./CheckoutFlow&#39;, &#39;./Cart&#39;],&#10;    resourceCategory: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;]);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { preloadRemotes } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@module-federation/enhanced/runtime'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preloadRemotes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    nameOrAlias: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'checkout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    exposes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./CheckoutFlow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./Cart'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    resourceCategory: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'all'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这解决了 MF 1.0 的「加载瀑布流」问题——多层 Federation（host → remote A → remote B）不再逐级等待，而是并行预加载整条链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MF 2.0 将运行时从打包器剥离，通过 manifest 协议实现跨工具互操作</li>\n<li>共享依赖通过运行时版本协商（semver + singleton）确保单实例一致性</li>\n<li>Tree Shaking 将共享依赖从全量暴露降至按需裁剪，减少 60-90% 体积</li>\n<li>Container entry 是打包器生成的标准接口，遵循 <code>init</code>/<code>get</code> 协议</li>\n<li>预加载 API 消除多层 Federation 的加载瀑布流</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-micro-frontends/implementation/module-federation\">微前端 Module Federation 实现</a> — 应用层的 MF 编排模式</li>\n<li><a href=\"../optimization/tree-shaking-deep\">Tree Shaking 深度机制</a> — 共享依赖 Tree Shaking 的底层分析</li>\n<li><a href=\"hmr-pipeline\">HMR 热更新管线</a> — Federation 模块的热替换策略</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Module Federation 运行时机制","id":"module-federation-运行时机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构：构建期 vs 运行时","id":"架构-构建期-vs-运行时"},{"level":2,"text":"Manifest 协议：mf-manifest.json","id":"manifest-协议-mf-manifest-json"},{"level":2,"text":"共享依赖协商：运行时版本仲裁","id":"共享依赖协商-运行时版本仲裁"},{"level":2,"text":"共享依赖的 Tree Shaking","id":"共享依赖的-tree-shaking"},{"level":2,"text":"Container Entry 的代码生成","id":"container-entry-的代码生成"},{"level":2,"text":"预加载与性能优化","id":"预加载与性能优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"持久化缓存与增量构建","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-bundler-internals/optimization/persistent-caching"},"next":{"title":"HMR 热更新管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-bundler-internals/advanced/hmr-pipeline"}}